{"id":"n37872-1-7","stage":4,"title":"끈끈하다 · 粘粘的","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n37872-1-7-1","ko":"식탁이 왜 이렇게 끈끈하지?","zh":"桌子怎么这么黏啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"식탁이","meaning":"餐桌","explanation":"식탁：餐桌；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"식탁","audio":"/audio/54440e480486cc26718c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26869","senseId":"1","lemma":"식탁","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"끈끈하지?","meaning":"粘粘的，粘糊糊的","explanation":"끈끈하다：粘粘的，粘糊糊的；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"끈끈하다","audio":"/audio/6825c4ff793a179ef917.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37872","senseId":"1","lemma":"끈끈하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"54440e480486cc26","term":"식탁","zh":"餐桌","audio":"/audio/54440e480486cc26718c.mp3","entryId":"26869","definition":"用于摆放食物、围坐起来用餐的桌子。","pronunciation":["식탁"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"6825c4ff793a179e","term":"끈끈하다","zh":"粘粘的，粘糊糊的","audio":"/audio/6825c4ff793a179ef917.mp3","entryId":"37872","definition":"因为沾有黏稠的物质而总感觉会粘在皮肤上。","pronunciation":["끈끈하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8f5a0edc83ec72c90445.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n37872-1-7-2","ko":"방금 전에 유민이가 콜라를 쏟았거든.","zh":"刚才裕敏把可乐洒在上面了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"방금","meaning":"刚才，方才","explanation":"방금：刚才，方才","readings":[{"term":"방금","audio":"/audio/2fd9e7d411752b4601d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"92065","senseId":"1","lemma":"방금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"전에","meaning":"以前","explanation":"전：以前；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"전","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17301","senseId":"1","lemma":"전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"유민이가","meaning":"裕敏","explanation":"유민：裕敏；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"유민이가","audio":"/audio/9f714db1c17c8ecf0221.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"콜라를","meaning":"可乐","explanation":"콜라：可乐；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"콜라","audio":"/audio/38c60dc0fd3443a877b9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17238","senseId":"1","lemma":"콜라","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쏟았거든.","meaning":"倒","explanation":"쏟다：倒；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；거든：补充理由或背景，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"쏟다","audio":"/audio/d31ee289987baedde891.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62333","senseId":"1","lemma":"쏟다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2fd9e7d411752b46","term":"방금","zh":"刚才，方才","audio":"/audio/2fd9e7d411752b4601d9.mp3","entryId":"92065","definition":"比说话时刻稍微早一点的时间。","pronunciation":["방금"]},{"id":"d9f427c3257e81e0","term":"전","zh":"以前","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3","entryId":"17301","definition":"过去的某时。","pronunciation":["전"]},{"id":"38c60dc0fd3443a8","term":"콜라","zh":"可乐","audio":"/audio/38c60dc0fd3443a877b9.mp3","entryId":"17238","definition":"味甜且具有独特的香味的黑色碳酸饮料。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"d31ee289987baedd","term":"쏟다","zh":"倒","audio":"/audio/d31ee289987baedde891.mp3","entryId":"62333","definition":"使碗等容器中的液体或物质浇到外面。","pronunciation":["쏟따"]}],"audio":"/audio/a25e3ced720a317120ab.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.378,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=37872","label"